### ============================================================
### PAYOUT SYSTEM - API TESTS
### Install: VS Code Extension → "REST Client" by Huachao Mao
### Usage: Click "Send Request" above each request
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@opsToken = REPLACE_WITH_OPS_TOKEN_AFTER_LOGIN
@financeToken = REPLACE_WITH_FINANCE_TOKEN_AFTER_LOGIN
@vendorId = REPLACE_WITH_VENDOR_ID
@payoutId = REPLACE_WITH_PAYOUT_ID


### ============================================================
### 🔐 AUTH
### ============================================================

### 1. Login as OPS
# @name opsLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ops@demo.com",
  "password": "ops123"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Login as FINANCE
# @name financeLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "finance@demo.com",
  "password": "fin123"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Login - Missing fields (should fail 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ops@demo.com"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 4. Login - Wrong password (should fail 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ops@demo.com",
  "password": "wrongpass"
}


### ============================================================
### 🏪 VENDORS
### ============================================================

### 5. Get all vendors (any logged-in user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Create vendor (OPS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kumar Electronics",
  "upi_id": "kumar@upi",
  "bank_account": "5566778899",
  "ifsc": "AXIS0001122"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Create vendor - Missing name (should fail 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "upi_id": "noname@upi"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 8. Create vendor - No token (should fail 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Vendor"
}


### ============================================================
### 💸 PAYOUTS - CREATE & READ
### ============================================================

### 9. Create payout - Draft (OPS only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor_id": "{{vendorId}}",
  "amount": 7500,
  "mode": "UPI",
  "note": "Test payout for API testing"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 10. Create payout - Invalid amount (should fail 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor_id": "{{vendorId}}",
  "amount": -100,
  "mode": "UPI"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 11. Create payout - FINANCE tries to create (should fail 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor_id": "{{vendorId}}",
  "amount": 5000,
  "mode": "IMPS"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 12. Get all payouts (no filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 13. Get payouts - Filter by status=Draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts?status=Draft
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 14. Get payouts - Filter by status=Submitted
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts?status=Submitted
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 15. Get payouts - Filter by status=Approved
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts?status=Approved
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 16. Get payouts - Filter by status=Rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts?status=Rejected
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 17. Get payouts - Pagination (page 1, limit 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts?page=1&limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 18. Get payout by ID (with audit trail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 19. Get payout - Invalid ID (should fail 500/cast error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/invalidid123
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}


### ============================================================
### 🔁 PAYOUT STATUS TRANSITIONS
### ============================================================

### 20. Submit payout - Draft → Submitted (OPS only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 21. Submit payout - FINANCE tries to submit (should fail 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 22. Submit payout - Already Submitted (should fail 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 23. Approve payout - Submitted → Approved (FINANCE only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 24. Approve payout - OPS tries to approve (should fail 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 25. Approve payout - Not Submitted status (should fail 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 26. Reject payout - Submitted → Rejected (FINANCE only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Invoice amount mismatch with PO"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 27. Reject payout - Missing reason (should fail 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 28. Reject payout - OPS tries to reject (should fail 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Should not work"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 29. Direct Draft → Approve (should fail 400 - invalid transition)
### First create a new Draft payout, then try to approve directly
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}


### ============================================================
### 🔒 SECURITY TESTS
### ============================================================

### 30. No token on protected route (should fail 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts

### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 31. Invalid token (should fail 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer invalidtoken.fake.jwt
